on":"Sotah 2b bears the name Chanina here. The exact Yuchasin report and the compiler’s absolute nonfinding of Elazar remain distinct claims.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sotah 2b:27","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sotah_2b.27"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The cited Sura passages verify the name here; Kiddushin spells it Surya. Sotah expands R. Yosi to R. Yosi son of R. Yehudah. The compiler’s report about Yuchasin and the broad nonfinding of Elazar remain attributed. Ketubot explicitly treats its narrative as exceptional.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Berakhot 52b:33","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Berakhot_52b.33"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Shabbat 23b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_23b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 79a:14","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_79a.14"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bava Batra 136a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Batra_136a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Niddah 52a:24","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_52a.24"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sotah 25a:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sotah_25a.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sotah 2b:27","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sotah_2b.27"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 63b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_63b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 63b:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_63b.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
